-- תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה, פרק 1ב', §1.27 העברת עובדי הוראה
-- Transfers of teaching employees: from one district to another at the
-- employee's request (1.27.1), within a district — initiated by the district
-- manager or requested by the employee (1.27.2) — and between the state and
-- the state-religious streams (1.27.3).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

@desc The actors of section 1.27: the takanon's shared parties, and the bodies this section names that the shared list lacks.
DECLARE `1.27 party` IS ONE OF
    `takanon party` HAS `the shared party` IS A Party
    `the teaching personnel division`
    `the director of the teaching personnel division`
    `the committee of supervisors`
    `the professional supervisor`
    `the religious-education director`
    `the director of the religious-education division`
    `the council for religious education`
    `the district personnel department`
    `the personnel team of the computing unit`
    `the minister`

`the employee`          MEANS `takanon party` `the teaching employee`
`the district manager`  MEANS `takanon party` `the district manager`
`the general supervisor` MEANS `takanon party` `the supervisor`
`the union`             MEANS `takanon party` `the teachers' union`

-- Time in 1.27.1 and 1.27.2 is counted in days of the calendar year, with
-- 1 January as day 1, in a common year; a leap year moves every date below
-- by one day and changes no order between them.
`31 March`  MEANS 90
`30 April`  MEANS 120
`30 June`   MEANS 181
`1 August`  MEANS 213
`5 August`  MEANS 217
`two weeks` MEANS 14
`one week`  MEANS 7

@desc What a party does under section 1.27.
DECLARE `transfer action` IS ONE OF
    `publish the annual notice`
    `submit a transfer request` HAS `request day` IS A NUMBER
    `handle or approve a late request`
    `notify the decision on the form` HAS `decision notice day` IS A NUMBER
    `appeal in writing` HAS `appeal day` IS A NUMBER
    `reconsider the request`
    `forward the appeal with an opinion`
    `decide the appeal`
    `transmit the decision to the employing district manager`
    `notify the wish to stay` HAS `stay notice day` IS A NUMBER
    `place another employee in the post`
    `request a temporary ban on incoming transfers`
    `request a temporary encouragement of incoming transfers`
    `announce by special circular`
    `check the facts and hear the employee`
    `send the transfer notice by registered mail` HAS `transfer notice day` IS A NUMBER
    `send a copy to the local union branch`
    `bring the decision to the head of the union`
    `forward the request with the religious supervisor's opinion`
    `decide on the stream transfer`
    `notify the employee`
    `explain the two options`
    `notify the severance computation`
    `arrange the dismissal by the minister`

§ `1.27 העברת עובדי הוראה`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27/p2 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27/p3 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27/p4 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27/p5 The page's table of contents: the headings of 1.27.1-1.27.3, which carry no rule of their own.

§§ `1.27.1 העברה ממחוז למחוז`

@desc A transfer request from one district to another, as section 1.27.1.1 describes it.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_1/p1
DECLARE `transfer request` HAS
    `submitted on day`                         IS A NUMBER  @desc day of the calendar year the request reached the district manager (1 January = 1)
    `is reasoned`                              IS A BOOLEAN
    `is from an official institution in one district to an official institution in another` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is on the request form of the district office` IS A BOOLEAN
    `attaches the documents needed`            IS A BOOLEAN
    `is filed as an original and two copies`   IS A BOOLEAN

-- 1.27.1.1 ¶1: the request goes to the manager of the district the employee
-- works in, by 31 March. The permission runs to that date, and once used the
-- district manager owes a decision by 30 April (1.27.1.4 ¶3, 1.27.1.5 ¶2).
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.27 party` `transfer action`
DECIDE `filing an inter-district transfer request` IS
    PARTY `the employee`
    MAY   `submit a transfer request` d PROVIDED d AT MOST `31 March`
    WITHIN `31 March`
    HENCE `the district manager decides by 30 April` d

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_1/p2
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.27 party` `transfer action`
DECIDE `the yearly notice of the deadline` IS
    PARTY `takanon party` `the director-general`
    MUST  `publish the annual notice`
    WITHIN `31 March`
    LEST  BREACH BY `takanon party` `the director-general` BECAUSE "1.27.1.1: the notice is published every year in the director-general's circular"

-- The text says "every year" and gives no date; the notice is read as due
-- before the deadline it announces, which is the only date that gives it use.

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_1/p3
GIVEN r IS A `transfer request`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the request was filed in time` r IF
    r's `submitted on day` AT MOST `31 March`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_1/p3
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.27 party` `transfer action`
DECIDE `no handling of a late request` IS
    PARTY `the district manager`
    SHANT `handle or approve a late request`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the district manager` BECAUSE "1.27.1.1: a request filed after 31 March is neither handled nor approved"

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_1/p4
GIVEN r IS A `transfer request`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the request is in due form` r IF
        r's `is on the request form of the district office`
    AND r's `attaches the documents needed`
    AND r's `is filed as an original and two copies`

§§ `1.27.1.2 תנאים מוקדמים לטיפול בבקשת העברה`

@desc The facts about an applicant that 1.27.1.2 and 1.27.1.3 ask about.
DECLARE `transfer applicant` HAS
    `is certified`                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `is permanent`                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `has delivered the medical clearance`             IS A BOOLEAN @desc confirmation that the medical examinations required of the employee are complete
    `completed years of service in this district`     IS A NUMBER
    `years of service`                                IS A NUMBER
    `is on unpaid leave`                              IS A BOOLEAN
    `supervision rates the work average or below`     IS A BOOLEAN
    `is proposed for pedagogical dismissal or a director-general warning` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is in negotiations to end the service`           IS A BOOLEAN
    `has unfinished conditional-loan obligations`     IS A BOOLEAN
    `permanent residence on the identity card is outside the district` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is a married woman whose husband lives in or moved for work to another district` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is a married woman whose husband is moved to another district by the army, police or security forces` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has delivered official confirmation of the husband's move` IS A BOOLEAN
    `pleads health or decisive family circumstances` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has the district health bureau's recommendation` IS A BOOLEAN
    `asks for a development town`                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `lives in a development town`                     IS A BOOLEAN

-- 1.27.1.2: the district manager shall not approve a transfer of an employee
-- in any of groups א-ח.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_2/p1
GIVEN a IS A `transfer applicant`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the applicant is barred from transfer` a IF
    -- uncertified AND not permanent
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_2__subpara_a
        ((NOT a's `is certified`) AND (NOT a's `is permanent`))
    -- no confirmation of the required medical examinations
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_2__subpara_b
    OR  (NOT a's `has delivered the medical clearance`)
    -- fewer than three years of service in the district
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_2__subpara_c
    OR  a's `completed years of service in this district` LESS THAN 3
    -- on unpaid leave for any reason
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_2__subpara_d
    OR  a's `is on unpaid leave`
    -- supervision's opinion "average" or lower
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_2__subpara_e
    OR  a's `supervision rates the work average or below`
    -- proposed for pedagogical dismissal or a director-general warning
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_2__subpara_f
    OR  a's `is proposed for pedagogical dismissal or a director-general warning`
    -- negotiations to end the service for any reason
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_2__subpara_g
    OR  a's `is in negotiations to end the service`
    -- conditional loans whose obligations are not yet met
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_2__subpara_h
    OR  a's `has unfinished conditional-loan obligations`

§§ `1.27.1.3 נימוקים לבקשת העברה`

-- 1.27.1.3: the district manager may approve only a request reasoned on one
-- or more of grounds א-ה.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_3/p1
GIVEN a IS A `transfer applicant`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the request rests on an admissible ground` a IF
    -- five years of service and a permanent residence outside the district
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_3__subpara_a
        (a's `years of service` AT LEAST 5 AND a's `permanent residence on the identity card is outside the district`)
    -- a married woman whose husband lives or moved for work elsewhere, with official confirmation
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_3__subpara_b
    OR  (a's `is a married woman whose husband lives in or moved for work to another district` AND a's `has delivered official confirmation of the husband's move`)
    -- a married woman whose husband is moved by the army, police or security forces, with official confirmation
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_3__subpara_c
    OR  (a's `is a married woman whose husband is moved to another district by the army, police or security forces` AND a's `has delivered official confirmation of the husband's move`)
    -- health or decisive family reasons, with the district health bureau's recommendation
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_3__subpara_d
    OR  (a's `pleads health or decisive family circumstances` AND a's `has the district health bureau's recommendation`)
    -- a transfer to a development town by one who does not live in one
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_3__subpara_e
    OR  (a's `asks for a development town` AND (NOT a's `lives in a development town`))

-- 1.27.1.3ה, the note: a pregnant employee whose expected delivery falls
-- within six weeks of the start of the school year gets a conditional
-- transfer, is not placed at the start of the year, and until placed is on
-- unpaid leave marked "as a conditionally transferred employee"; she is told
-- in advance that this leave bears on National Insurance maternity pay.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_3__subpara_e/p2
GIVEN `weeks from the start of the year to the expected delivery` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a pregnant transferee is not placed at the start of the year` `weeks from the start of the year to the expected delivery` IF
    `weeks from the start of the year to the expected delivery` AT MOST 6

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_3__subpara_e/p2
DECLARE `pregnant transferee notice` IS ONE OF
    `unpaid leave noted as a conditional transferee's`
    `told in advance that the leave bears on maternity pay`

§§ `1.27.1.4 אשור הבקשה`

@desc The opinions and consultations 1.27.1.4 requires before approval.
DECLARE `approval file` HAS
    `the conditions above are met`                    IS A BOOLEAN @desc 1.27.1.1-1.27.1.3: filed in time and in form, no bar, an admissible ground
    `the general supervisor's opinion was read`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `teaches vocational-training subjects`            IS A BOOLEAN
    `the professional supervisor's opinion was read`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `works in a religious institution`                IS A BOOLEAN
    `the religious-education director was consulted`  IS A BOOLEAN

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_4/p1
GIVEN f IS A `approval file`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the district manager may decide to approve` f IF
        f's `the conditions above are met`
    AND f's `the general supervisor's opinion was read`
    AND ((NOT f's `teaches vocational-training subjects`) OR f's `the professional supervisor's opinion was read`)
    AND ((NOT f's `works in a religious institution`)    OR f's `the religious-education director was consulted`)

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_4/p2
DECLARE `staffing consideration` IS ONE OF
    `surplus or shortage of staff in the district`
    `the hours standard`
    `class regulation`
    `population mobility`
    `other factors bearing on the teaching force of the district`

-- 1.27.1.4 ¶3 and 1.27.1.5 ¶2: approval or rejection alike is notified to the
-- employee on the form by 30 April. The obligation runs from the request.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_4/p3 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_5/p2
GIVEN `filed on` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.27 party` `transfer action`
DECIDE `the district manager decides by 30 April` `filed on` IS
    PARTY `the district manager`
    MUST  `notify the decision on the form` n PROVIDED n AT MOST `30 April`
    WITHIN `30 April` MINUS `filed on`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the district manager` BECAUSE "1.27.1.4/1.27.1.5: the decision is notified on the form by 30 April"

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_4/p4 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_5/p4
DECLARE `who is told of the decision` IS ONE OF
    `the general supervisor is told`
    `the professional supervisor is told, for a vocational-training teacher`
    `the religious-education director is told, for an employee in religious education`

GIVEN `vocational` IS A BOOLEAN, `religious` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A LIST OF `who is told of the decision`
DECIDE `the decision is brought to` `vocational` `religious` IS
    `the general supervisor is told` FOLLOWED BY
        append (IF `vocational` THEN LIST `the professional supervisor is told, for a vocational-training teacher` ELSE EMPTY)
               (IF `religious`  THEN LIST `the religious-education director is told, for an employee in religious education` ELSE EMPTY)

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_4/p5
DECLARE `where the approved request goes` IS ONE OF
    `the original with the decision, to the computing unit's personnel team for the leave-and-transfer file`
    `a copy, to the employee's personal file in the district`

§§ `1.27.1.5 דחיית הבקשה`

-- 1.27.1.5 ¶1: the manager rejects a request barred by "sections 1 and 2"
-- (late, or a barred applicant) and/or after the reading and consultation of
-- "section 3". See F-1.27-a: the reading and consultation are 1.27.1.4.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_5/p1
GIVEN r IS A `transfer request`, a IS A `transfer applicant`, `rejected on the merits after consultation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the district manager rejects` r a `rejected on the merits after consultation` IF
        (NOT `the request was filed in time` r)
    OR  `the applicant is barred from transfer` a
    OR  (NOT `the request rests on an admissible ground` a)
    OR  `rejected on the merits after consultation`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_5/p3
DECLARE `rejection notice` HAS
    `states the reasons`                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `points to the right to appeal in writing to the district manager` IS A BOOLEAN

GIVEN n IS A `rejection notice`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the rejection notice is complete` n IF
    n's `states the reasons` AND n's `points to the right to appeal in writing to the district manager`

-- 1.27.1.5 ¶4 (a copy of the rejection in the personal file) is with the
-- list of who is told, above.

§§ `1.27.1.6 ערעורים`

-- 1.27.1.6 ¶1-¶5: a written appeal within two weeks of receiving the
-- negative decision obliges the district manager to reconsider; if he cannot
-- grant it he forwards it, with his opinion on the appeal form, to the
-- teaching personnel division, which decides finally.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_6/p1
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.27 party` `transfer action`
DECIDE `appealing a rejection` IS
    PARTY `the employee`
    MAY   `appeal in writing` d
    WITHIN `two weeks`
    HENCE (PARTY `the district manager`
           MUST  `reconsider the request`
           HENCE `the district manager grants or forwards the appeal`)

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_6/p2 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_6/p3
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.27 party` `transfer action`
DECIDE `the district manager grants or forwards the appeal` IS
         (PARTY `the district manager` MAY `notify the decision on the form` n)
    ROR  (PARTY `the district manager`
          MUST  `forward the appeal with an opinion`
          HENCE `the division decides an inter-district appeal`)

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_6/p4
DECLARE `appeal file` IS ONE OF
    `the original request, original and copy, attached to the appeal`
    `a copy of the request and of the appeal form, in the personal file`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_6/p5 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_6/p6
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.27 party` `transfer action`
DECIDE `the division decides an inter-district appeal` IS
    PARTY `the teaching personnel division`
    MUST  `decide the appeal`
    HENCE (PARTY `the teaching personnel division` MUST `transmit the decision to the employing district manager`)

-- "החלטתו תהיה סופית": no further appeal lies from the division's decision.
`a further appeal lies from the division's decision` MEANS FALSE

-- 1.27.1.6 ¶7-¶8 send a positive decision to "section 3" and a negative one
-- to "section 4" (approval). Read under F-1.27-a: positive -> the approval
-- clause (1.27.1.4), negative -> the rejection clause (1.27.1.5).
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_6/p7 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_6/p8
GIVEN `the division accepted the appeal` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the clause the district manager then acts under` `the division accepted the appeal` IS
    IF `the division accepted the appeal` THEN 4 ELSE 5

-- F-1.27-a: the clause numbers the text cites, against the clause whose
-- subject each citation needs. Every one is one clause short.
DECLARE `clause citation` HAS
    `where cited`           IS A STRING
    `clause number cited`   IS A NUMBER
    `clause the subject is in` IS A NUMBER

`the clause citations of 1.27.1` MEANS
    LIST `clause citation` "1.27.1.5: reading and consultation"            3 4,
         `clause citation` "1.27.1.6: appeal accepted by the manager"      3 4,
         `clause citation` "1.27.1.6: positive decision of the division"   3 4,
         `clause citation` "1.27.1.6: negative decision of the division"   4 5,
         `clause citation` "1.27.1.8: the notice of the wish to stay"      6 7

`every clause citation of 1.27.1 is one clause short` MEANS
    all (GIVEN c YIELD c's `clause the subject is in` EQUALS c's `clause number cited` PLUS 1)
        `the clause citations of 1.27.1`
#ASSERT `every clause citation of 1.27.1 is one clause short`

§§ `1.27.1.7 העברה שאושרה ואינה מנוצלת`

DECLARE `conditional transferee` HAS
    `day the conditional transfer was approved` IS A NUMBER
    `offered work in the receiving district by 1 August` IS A BOOLEAN
    `placed in the receiving district by 1 August`     IS A BOOLEAN
    `day the wish to stay was notified`                 IS A NUMBER @desc 0 when no notice was given
    `not placed through no fault of his own`            IS A BOOLEAN

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_7/p1
GIVEN t IS A `conditional transferee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may stay in the permanent post` t IF
        (NOT t's `offered work in the receiving district by 1 August`)
    AND t's `day the wish to stay was notified` GREATER THAN 0
    AND t's `day the wish to stay was notified` AT MOST `5 August`

-- 1.27.1.7 ¶1-¶2: the notice is in writing, by registered mail or telegram,
-- to both district managers, by 5 August — also where the conditional
-- transfer was approved after the 30 April date.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_7/p1 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_7/p2
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.27 party` `transfer action`
DECIDE `keeping the permanent post` IS
    PARTY `the employee`
    MAY   `notify the wish to stay` d PROVIDED d AT MOST `5 August`
    WITHIN `5 August`
    LEST  `the sending district may fill the post`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_7/p3
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.27 party` `transfer action`
DECIDE `the sending district may fill the post` IS
    PARTY `the district manager`
    MAY   `place another employee in the post`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_7/p4
GIVEN t IS A `conditional transferee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the post in the sending district is lost` t IF
    t's `placed in the receiving district by 1 August`

-- F-1.27-b: offered work by 1 August but not placed: ¶1's right to stay
-- needs "not offered", ¶4's loss of the post needs "placed".
`offered but not placed` MEANS
    `conditional transferee` WITH
        `day the conditional transfer was approved`        IS 110
        `offered work in the receiving district by 1 August` IS TRUE
        `placed in the receiving district by 1 August`     IS FALSE
        `day the wish to stay was notified`                 IS 215
        `not placed through no fault of his own`            IS FALSE

`an employee offered work but not placed may neither stay nor loses the post` MEANS
        (NOT `may stay in the permanent post` `offered but not placed`)
    AND (NOT `the post in the sending district is lost` `offered but not placed`)
#ASSERT `an employee offered work but not placed may neither stay nor loses the post`

§§ `1.27.1.8 תקופת המעבר`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_8/p1
GIVEN t IS A `conditional transferee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the wait until placement counts as unpaid leave` t IF
        (NOT t's `placed in the receiving district by 1 August`)
    AND t's `not placed through no fault of his own`
    AND (NOT (t's `day the wish to stay was notified` GREATER THAN 0))

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_8/p2
GIVEN t IS A `conditional transferee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `every unpaid-leave approval notes the status is unchanged` t IF
    `the wait until placement counts as unpaid leave` t

§§ `1.27.1.9 שיבוץ עובד מועבר`

-- 1.27.1.9 ¶1: placement only in an approved hours standard, ahead of these.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_9/p1
DECLARE `candidate for a post` IS ONE OF
    `a conditional transferee`
    `a new referral`
    `a candidate on a special contract of any kind`
    `a seminar student with an employment permit`
    `an employee on overtime hours`
    `an enlargement of another employee's position`

GIVEN c IS A `candidate for a post`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `goes before every other candidate listed` c IF
    CONSIDER c
    WHEN `a conditional transferee` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_9/p1
GIVEN `the hours are in an approved standard` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a conditional transferee may be placed` `the hours are in an approved standard` IF
    `the hours are in an approved standard`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_9/p2
GIVEN `position fraction in the sending district` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `position offered to a conditional transferee` `position fraction in the sending district` IS
    min `position fraction in the sending district` 1

-- 1.27.1.9 ¶3: no effort spared so that the wait does not pass six years,
-- the longest unpaid leave a district manager may approve to an official
-- teaching employee.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_9/p3
GIVEN `years waited` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the wait has passed the six-year aim` `years waited` IF
    `years waited` GREATER THAN 6

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_9/p4
GIVEN `taught in a middle school` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `must be placed in a middle school` `taught in a middle school` IF FALSE

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_9/p4
`the remark on a middle-school transferee's form` MEANS "זכאי לעבוד גם בחט\"ב"

§§ `1.27.1.10–1.27.1.11 איסור ועידוד זמניים`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_10/p1 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_11/p1
GIVEN `the district has surplus teachers` IS A BOOLEAN, `the district has a shortage of teachers` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.27 party` `transfer action`
DECIDE `asking to ban or encourage incoming transfers` `the district has surplus teachers` `the district has a shortage of teachers` IS
    IF `the district has surplus teachers`
    THEN PARTY `the district manager` MAY `request a temporary ban on incoming transfers`
         HENCE `the division announces its decision`
    ELSE IF `the district has a shortage of teachers`
         THEN PARTY `the district manager` MAY `request a temporary encouragement of incoming transfers`
              HENCE `the division announces its decision`
         ELSE FULFILLED

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_10/p2 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_11/p2
DECLARE `scope of a ban or encouragement` IS ONE OF
    `general`
    `by stream`
    `by stage of education`
    `by teaching subject`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_10/p3 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_11/p3
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.27 party` `transfer action`
DECIDE `the division announces its decision` IS
    PARTY `the director of the teaching personnel division`
    MUST  `announce by special circular`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1/p1 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1/p2 The sources of 1.27.1 (אסמכתא): a teaching-personnel-division circular.

§§ `1.27.2 העברה בתוך המחוז`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_2/p1 Heading of the initiated transfers ("העברות יזומות"); its rules follow.

@desc A transfer the district manager initiates inside the district (1.27.2.1).
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_2/p2
DECLARE `initiated transfer` HAS
    `during the school year`                 IS A BOOLEAN @desc FALSE for a transfer towards a new school year
    `a class or stream was closed or the standard reduced` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the transfer saves travel and travel expenses` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the employee was appointed principal, deputy principal or coordinator` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the employee is surplus`                IS A BOOLEAN
    `the transfer completes the employee's position` IS A BOOLEAN
    `km from the new post to the residence`  IS A NUMBER
    `to an official institution of the same stream` IS A BOOLEAN
    `new position fraction`                  IS A NUMBER
    `permanent position fraction`            IS A NUMBER

-- 1.27.2.1א: in the year, after a class closed or the standard was cut, a
-- surplus employee may be moved (or the position completed) to another
-- official institution of the same stream, within the permanent position and
-- not above one full position, within 30 km of the residence.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_2/p2
GIVEN t IS A `initiated transfer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the in-year initiated transfer is allowed` t IF
        t's `during the school year`
    AND t's `a class or stream was closed or the standard reduced`
    AND (t's `the employee is surplus` OR t's `the transfer completes the employee's position`)
    AND t's `to an official institution of the same stream`
    AND t's `new position fraction` AT MOST min (t's `permanent position fraction`) 1
    AND t's `km from the new post to the residence` AT MOST 30

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_2/p2
DECLARE `in-year transfer notice` HAS
    `signed by the district manager`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `sent by the district personnel department on the usual form` IS A BOOLEAN
    `gives the reasons`                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `names the receiving institution and its address` IS A BOOLEAN

-- 1.27.2.1ב, read under F-1.27-c: towards a new year the manager may
-- initiate a transfer within 30 km in any of three cases — a closure or a
-- reduced standard; a saving in travel; an appointment as principal, deputy
-- or coordinator.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_2/p3 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_2/p4
GIVEN t IS A `initiated transfer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a case for a new-year initiated transfer` t IF
        t's `a class or stream was closed or the standard reduced`
    OR  t's `the transfer saves travel and travel expenses`
    OR  t's `the employee was appointed principal, deputy principal or coordinator`

-- The other reading: the saving in travel is a CONDITION of the closure case.
GIVEN t IS A `initiated transfer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a case for a new-year initiated transfer, travel read as a condition` t IF
        (t's `a class or stream was closed or the standard reduced` AND t's `the transfer saves travel and travel expenses`)
    OR  t's `the employee was appointed principal, deputy principal or coordinator`

`a transfer only to save travel` MEANS
    `initiated transfer` WITH
        `during the school year`                 IS FALSE
        `a class or stream was closed or the standard reduced` IS FALSE
        `the transfer saves travel and travel expenses` IS TRUE
        `the employee was appointed principal, deputy principal or coordinator` IS FALSE
        `the employee is surplus`                IS FALSE
        `the transfer completes the employee's position` IS FALSE
        `km from the new post to the residence`  IS 12
        `to an official institution of the same stream` IS TRUE
        `new position fraction`                  IS 1
        `permanent position fraction`            IS 1

-- F-1.27-c: the two readings of 1.27.2.1ב differ on a transfer whose only
-- ground is the saving in travel.
`the readings of the new-year cases differ on a travel-only transfer` MEANS
    NOT (`a case for a new-year initiated transfer` `a transfer only to save travel`
         EQUALS `a case for a new-year initiated transfer, travel read as a condition` `a transfer only to save travel`)
#ASSERT `the readings of the new-year cases differ on a travel-only transfer`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_2/p3 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_2/p5
GIVEN t IS A `initiated transfer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the new-year initiated transfer is allowed` t IF
        (NOT t's `during the school year`)
    AND `a case for a new-year initiated transfer` t
    AND t's `km from the new post to the residence` AT MOST 30
    AND t's `to an official institution of the same stream`
    AND t's `new position fraction` EQUALS min (t's `permanent position fraction`) 1

-- 1.27.2.1ב ¶2: before the decision, the direct supervisor checks the facts
-- and hears the employee; the record goes through the district personnel
-- department, with the personal file, to the district manager.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_2/p4
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.27 party` `transfer action`
DECIDE `hearing before an initiated transfer` IS
    PARTY `the general supervisor`
    MUST  `check the facts and hear the employee`
    HENCE `the notice of a new-year initiated transfer`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_2/p6
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.27 party` `transfer action`
DECIDE `the notice of a new-year initiated transfer` IS
         (PARTY `the district manager`
          MUST  `send the transfer notice by registered mail` d PROVIDED d AT MOST `30 June`
          WITHIN `30 June`
          LEST  BREACH BY `the district manager` BECAUSE "1.27.2.1ב: the signed notice with its reasons goes by registered mail by 30 June")
    RAND (PARTY `the district manager`
          MUST  `send a copy to the local union branch`)

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_2/p7
GIVEN `on unpaid leave from a training fund` IS A BOOLEAN, t IS A `initiated transfer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be transferred while on training-fund leave` `on unpaid leave from a training fund` t IF
    `the new-year initiated transfer is allowed` t

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_2/p8 Heading "ג. ערעור העובד"; its rule follows.

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_2/p9
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.27 party` `transfer action`
DECIDE `appealing an initiated transfer` IS
    PARTY `the employee`
    MAY   `appeal in writing` d
    WITHIN `one week`
    HENCE (     (PARTY `the district manager` MAY `notify the employee`)
           ROR  (PARTY `the district manager`
                 MUST  `forward the appeal with an opinion`
                 HENCE `the division decides an initiated-transfer appeal`))

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_2/p9
GIVEN `the employee holds the transfer worsens the conditions of work` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `there is a ground to appeal an initiated transfer` `the employee holds the transfer worsens the conditions of work` IF
    `the employee holds the transfer worsens the conditions of work`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_2/p10
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.27 party` `transfer action`
DECIDE `the division decides an initiated-transfer appeal` IS
    PARTY `the director of the teaching personnel division`
    MUST  `decide the appeal`
    HENCE (PARTY `the director of the teaching personnel division` MUST `bring the decision to the head of the union`)

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_2/p11 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_2/p12 Headings "2. העברה לפי בקשת העובד" and "א. הגשת הבקשה"; their rules follow.

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_2/p13
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.27 party` `transfer action`
DECIDE `requesting a move inside the district` IS
    PARTY `the employee`
    MAY   `submit a transfer request` d PROVIDED d AT MOST `31 March`
    WITHIN `31 March`
    HENCE (PARTY `the district manager` MUST `notify the employee`)

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_2/p14 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_2/p15
DECLARE `in-district request review` HAS
    `decided by the committee of supervisors of the stream` IS A BOOLEAN
    `weighs the inter-district conditions and grounds` IS A BOOLEAN
    `weighs the fit to the requested workplace` IS A BOOLEAN
    `weighs the nearness of the residence`      IS A BOOLEAN
    `weighs a certified health need`            IS A BOOLEAN

GIVEN v IS A `in-district request review`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the in-district request was properly reviewed` v IF
        v's `decided by the committee of supervisors of the stream`
    AND v's `weighs the inter-district conditions and grounds`
    -- (א) the employee's fit to the workplace asked for
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_2/p16
    AND v's `weighs the fit to the requested workplace`
    -- (ב) how near the employee lives
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_2/p17
    AND v's `weighs the nearness of the residence`
    -- (ג) a health need certified by the district health bureau
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_2/p18
    AND v's `weighs a certified health need`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_2/p19
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.27 party` `transfer action`
DECIDE `telling the employee the in-district decision` IS
    PARTY `the district manager`
    MUST  `notify the employee`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_2/p20
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.27 party` `transfer action`
DECIDE `appealing a refused in-district request` IS
    PARTY `the employee`
    MAY   `appeal in writing` d
    WITHIN `two weeks`
    HENCE (PARTY `the district manager` MUST `forward the appeal with an opinion`
           HENCE (PARTY `the director of the teaching personnel division` MUST `decide the appeal`))

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_2/p21 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_2/p22 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_2/p23 The sources of 1.27.2 (אסמכתא): a director-general circular and the teaching-personnel-division circular and procedure.

§§ `1.27.3 העברה ממגמה למגמה`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_3/p1
DECLARE `stream` IS ONE OF `state`, `state-religious`

@desc A request to move between the state and the state-religious streams.
DECLARE `stream transfer request` HAS
    `from stream`                         IS A `stream`
    `to stream`                           IS A `stream`
    `in writing to the district office`   IS A BOOLEAN
    `with the declaration of the placement queue` IS A BOOLEAN @desc that, if approved, the employee is placed in the new stream with the conditional transferees of other districts, by seniority and other rights, and agrees to it

GIVEN q IS A `stream transfer request`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the stream request is in due form` q IF
    q's `in writing to the district office` AND q's `with the declaration of the placement queue`

-- 1.27.3.2: the committee is of supervisors of the stream asked for.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_3/p2
GIVEN q IS A `stream transfer request`
GIVETH A `stream`
DECIDE `the stream of the committee's supervisors` q IS q's `to stream`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_3/p3
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.27 party` `transfer action`
DECIDE `the direct supervisor forwards the request` IS
    PARTY `the general supervisor`
    MUST  `forward the appeal with an opinion`

-- 1.27.3.4-1.27.3.6: who decides depends on the direction.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_3/p4 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_3/p5
GIVEN q IS A `stream transfer request`
GIVETH A `1.27 party`
DECIDE `who decides the stream transfer` q IS
    CONSIDER q's `to stream`
    WHEN `state`           THEN `the district manager`
    WHEN `state-religious` THEN `the council for religious education`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_3/p5 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_3/p6
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.27 party` `transfer action`
DECIDE `a request to move into the state-religious stream` IS
    PARTY `the district manager`
    MUST  `forward the request with the religious supervisor's opinion`
    HENCE (PARTY `the council for religious education`
           MUST  `decide on the stream transfer`
           HENCE (PARTY `the director of the religious-education division`
                  MUST  `notify the decision on the form` n
                  HENCE (PARTY `the district manager` MUST `notify the employee`)))

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_3/p4
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.27 party` `transfer action`
DECIDE `a request to move into the state stream` IS
    PARTY `the committee of supervisors`
    MUST  `forward the appeal with an opinion`
    HENCE (PARTY `the district manager`
           MUST  `decide on the stream transfer`
           HENCE (PARTY `the district manager` MUST `notify the employee`))

-- 1.27.3.7, as written: approved -> placement priority as a conditional
-- transferee; not approved -> "placed in the state stream".
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_3/p7 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_3/p8
GIVEN q IS A `stream transfer request`, `approved` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `stream`
DECIDE `the stream placed in, as written` q `approved` IS
    IF `approved` THEN q's `to stream` ELSE `state`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_3/p7
GIVEN `approved` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `has placement priority as a conditional transferee` `approved` IF `approved`

-- The reading adopted (F-1.27-d): a refused request leaves the employee in
-- the stream he asked to leave.
GIVEN q IS A `stream transfer request`, `approved` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `stream`
DECIDE `the stream placed in` q `approved` IS
    IF `approved` THEN q's `to stream` ELSE q's `from stream`

`a refused request to leave religious education` MEANS
    `stream transfer request` WITH
        `from stream`                         IS `state-religious`
        `to stream`                           IS `state`
        `in writing to the district office`   IS TRUE
        `with the declaration of the placement queue` IS TRUE

-- F-1.27-d: as written, refusing a move into the state stream places the
-- employee in the state stream — what was refused.
`a refused move into the state stream lands the employee in it` MEANS
    `the stream placed in, as written` `a refused request to leave religious education` FALSE
        EQUALS `a refused request to leave religious education`'s `to stream`
#ASSERT `a refused move into the state stream lands the employee in it`

-- 1.27.3.8: a teacher the council disqualifies from state-religious service.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_3/p9
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.27 party` `transfer action`
DECIDE `notice of disqualification` IS
    PARTY `takanon party` `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `notify the employee`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_3/p10
GIVEN `the district manager agrees to employ the teacher in state education` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.27 party` `transfer action`
DECIDE `after a disqualification` `the district manager agrees to employ the teacher in state education` IS
    IF `the district manager agrees to employ the teacher in state education`
    THEN PARTY `the district manager` MUST `explain the two options`
    ELSE PARTY `the district manager` MUST `notify the severance computation`
         LEST `dismissal of a teacher who refuses severance`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_3/p10
DECLARE `option of a disqualified teacher` IS ONE OF
    -- (א) severance pay
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_3/p11
    `take severance pay`
    -- (ב) a transfer to a state institution
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_3/p12
    `take a transfer to a state institution`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_3/p13
GIVEN o IS A `option of a disqualified teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `queues with the conditional transferees of other districts` o IF
    CONSIDER o
    WHEN `take a transfer to a state institution` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

-- 1.27.3.8 ¶6-¶7: the manager who finds reasons not to employ notifies the
-- severance computation; a teacher who refuses it is dismissed by the
-- minister, through the teaching personnel division.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_3/p14 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_3/p15
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.27 party` `transfer action`
DECIDE `dismissal of a teacher who refuses severance` IS
    PARTY `the district manager`
    MUST  `arrange the dismissal by the minister`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_3/p16 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_3/p17 The source of 1.27.3 (אסמכתא): a teaching-personnel-division circular.

§§ `Findings with no example above`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_1/p1 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_27__ssec_1_27_1__para_2__subpara_a
-- F-1.27-e: 1.27.1.1 opens the procedure to a CERTIFIED employee ("עובד
-- הוראה מוסמך (להלן: עובד)"), while 1.27.1.2א bars only one who is
-- uncertified AND not permanent — so an uncertified permanent employee is
-- outside the procedure by the first and not barred by the second.
`an uncertified permanent employee` MEANS
    `transfer applicant` WITH
        `is certified`                                    IS FALSE
        `is permanent`                                    IS TRUE
        `has delivered the medical clearance`             IS TRUE
        `completed years of service in this district`     IS 6
        `years of service`                                IS 6
        `is on unpaid leave`                              IS FALSE
        `supervision rates the work average or below`     IS FALSE
        `is proposed for pedagogical dismissal or a director-general warning` IS FALSE
        `is in negotiations to end the service`           IS FALSE
        `has unfinished conditional-loan obligations`     IS FALSE
        `permanent residence on the identity card is outside the district` IS TRUE
        `is a married woman whose husband lives in or moved for work to another district` IS FALSE
        `is a married woman whose husband is moved to another district by the army, police or security forces` IS FALSE
        `has delivered official confirmation of the husband's move` IS FALSE
        `pleads health or decisive family circumstances` IS FALSE
        `has the district health bureau's recommendation` IS FALSE
        `asks for a development town`                     IS FALSE
        `lives in a development town`                     IS FALSE

`an uncertified permanent employee is outside 1.27.1.1 yet not barred by 1.27.1.2` MEANS
        (NOT `an uncertified permanent employee`'s `is certified`)
    AND (NOT `the applicant is barred from transfer` `an uncertified permanent employee`)
#ASSERT `an uncertified permanent employee is outside 1.27.1.1 yet not barred by 1.27.1.2`

-- Worked examples (placeholder facts, not from any case).
`a request filed on 20 March` MEANS
    `transfer request` WITH
        `submitted on day`                         IS 79
        `is reasoned`                              IS TRUE
        `is from an official institution in one district to an official institution in another` IS TRUE
        `is on the request form of the district office` IS TRUE
        `attaches the documents needed`            IS TRUE
        `is filed as an original and two copies`   IS TRUE

#ASSERT `the request was filed in time` `a request filed on 20 March`
#ASSERT `the request is in due form` `a request filed on 20 March`
#ASSERT `the request rests on an admissible ground` `an uncertified permanent employee`
#ASSERT `position offered to a conditional transferee` 1.25 EQUALS 1

-- Filed on 20 March, answered on 25 April: in time. Answered on 2 May: late.
#TRACE `filing an inter-district transfer request` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employee` DOES `submit a transfer request` 79 AT 79
    PARTY `the district manager` DOES `notify the decision on the form` 115 AT 115
#TRACE `filing an inter-district transfer request` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employee` DOES `submit a transfer request` 79 AT 79
    PARTY `the district manager` DOES `notify the decision on the form` 122 AT 122

-- The notice of a new-year initiated transfer, sent on 20 June with a copy to the union.
#TRACE `the notice of a new-year initiated transfer` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the district manager` DOES `send the transfer notice by registered mail` 171 AT 171
    PARTY `the district manager` DOES `send a copy to the local union branch` AT 172
